Linux wheels (in kitten_inference_tts08.libs/):

- libgomp-*.so.*: libgomp, the GNU OpenMP runtime library from GCC, copied
  unchanged (apart from its file name and dynamic-section entries set by
  auditwheel) from the build image: AlmaLinux 8 libgomp 8.5.0 (8.5.0-28 or
  -29.el8_10.alma.1) in the manylinux_2_28 wheels, CentOS 7 libgomp 4.8.5
  (4.8.5-44.el7) in the manylinux2014 wheels; the software bill of materials
  in each wheel's .dist-info names the exact package.
  Copyright (C) Free Software Foundation, Inc. Licensed under the GNU General
  Public License, version 3 or later, with the GCC Runtime Library Exception,
  version 3.1: licenses/GPL-3.0.txt and licenses/GCC-exception-3.1.txt.
  Source code: the gcc source packages of those releases
  (https://vault.almalinux.org/8.10/BaseOS/Source/ and
  https://vault.centos.org/7.9.2009/os/Source/), and https://gcc.gnu.org.

Windows wheels (in kitten_inference_tts08.libs/):

- msvcp140-*.dll and vcomp140-*.dll (and vcruntime140_1-*.dll in the CPython
  3.8 wheels): the Microsoft Visual C++ runtime and OpenMP runtime libraries,
  copied by delvewheel from the redistributable folder (VC\Redist) of the
  Visual Studio that built the engine, and distributed under its licence
  terms for distributable code
  (https://learn.microsoft.com/visualstudio/releases/2026/redistribution).
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.

Android wheel (in kitten_inference_tts08.libs/):

- libc++_shared-*.so: the LLVM C++ standard library (libc++) from the Android
  NDK. Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions: licenses/libc++.txt.

Not included
------------
- Model weights. On first use the package downloads them from Hugging Face
  (KittenML/meownn-models, revision 5e9bca0cc3a4e2a617f604b1333d5f34536c1eed);
  they are subject to the terms on their Hugging Face page.
- Runtime dependencies, which pip installs separately under their own
  licenses. Among them, phonemizer and the espeak-ng library shipped by
  espeakng_loader are GPL-3.0.
